WEBVTT

00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:31.711
we can launch into orbit

00:00:31.735 --> 00:00:36.607
any payload that has previously
been conceived or is conceived right now.

00:00:36.631 --> 00:00:39.584
We've got a couple of launches
of Falcon Heavy later this year,

00:00:39.608 --> 00:00:41.264
so this had to go right.

00:00:41.288 --> 00:00:43.646
It was the first time we flew it,

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.469
and the star of the show, of course,

00:00:45.493 --> 00:00:48.017
brother and sister side boosters landing.

00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:49.192
I was excited.

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:50.819
(Laughter)

00:00:50.843 --> 00:00:51.994
Thanking my team.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:54.066
By the way, there's maybe
a thousand people

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.709
standing around me right there.

00:00:56.682 --> 00:00:57.832
And Starman.

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:00.310
Starman did not steal the show, though --